ot/issues/comments/3241039658/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3241055861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110154#issuecomment-3241055861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110154","id":3241055861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BLpZ1","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T06:44:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T06:44:59Z","body":"> I see, so 4.5 will be the last version to officially support Intel Macs?\n\nNo, probably not, most likely Intel macs will be supposed while Apple supports it, macOS 26, which is the last version with Intel support, will be released in a month, and Apple usually keeps releasing security updates for about 3 years after release. But adding huge platform specific features, like new renderer are highly unlikely.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/